","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":283518733,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyODM1MTg3MzM=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/usability","name":"usability","color":"447744","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-01-16T20:50:48Z","updated_at":"2026-01-17T10:49:24Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nTested: 4.6rc and 4.5.1\n\n\n\n### System information\n\nLinux\n\n### Issue description\n\n<img width=\"1596\" height=\"820\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/37b9cc4d-bc9f-4e3e-870d-a48c89de7f15\" />\n\nThe left column is `Main Run Args` and `Override Main Run Args`. If the box is unchecked, the `Launch Arguments` column is ignored. If the box is checked, the `Main Run Args` are replaced with the `Launch Arguments`\n\n\nThe right column `Main Feature Tags` and `Override Main Tags`. Unchecking that box *COMBINES* the two. Checking the box *REPLACES* the args.\n\nThese are very different behaviors between the two columns here, despite using the same wording.\n\nAn easy fix might be to replace \"Override\" with a different word; \"Features\" column could be called \"Combine\". A better fix could be a drop down instead of an checkbox for `combine`,`replace`,`ignore` for both columns and add both sets of behavior to both columns.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nOpen `[Run Instances]`, add args like my image. Toggle checkboxes and test the args and features.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nThe Run Instances data does not save with a project, so you'll have to do manual steps anyway.\n\nJust add this function to test:\n\n```gdscript\nfunc _ready():\n\tvar args = OS.get_cmdline_args()\n\tprint(args)\n\tfor feature in [\"no_steam\",\"hello\",\"world\",\"does_not_exist\"]:\n\t\tvar has = OS.has_feature(feature)\n\t\tprint(\"%s = %s\" % [feature,has])\n```","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115046/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115046/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}